      <reaction id="mw7cee9055_1961_49d1_8f48_163f72df7341" name="Reaction_30" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Tumor-local Treg renewal, SATURATING in density (rho_Treg_max*V_T is the half-saturation density, NOT a hard ceiling). Reformulated 2026-07-13 from the unclamped logistic, which -- with the tumoral death removed on 2026-06-17 -- was forced permanently negative and ran as a quadratic sink (see the death reaction above and notes/model/tcell_carrying_capacity_inversion.md). This form is monotone in k_Treg_pro_tumor and in influx at every density, so the Cy throttle that gvax_module appends here (*(1 - Emax_Cy_Treg*...)) now correctly REMOVES Tregs instead of adding them. The pool is bounded by k_Treg_death (restored above), not by the cap. k_Treg_pro_tumor keeps its Ki67 submodel anchor. Mechanism-specific losses remain explicit: Cy depletion (gvax_module) and post-eradication clearance (below). The apCAF-driven additive cap (rho_Treg_apCAF_extra*H_apCAF) was retired 2026-05-01; direct Th→Treg conversion via apCAF (k_apCAF_Treg, fibroblast_module_enhanced) remains the residual apCAF→Treg coupling.</body>
        </notes>
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference species="mw79a71ac6_adc6_4054_be96_1a4c8572f207" stoichiometry="1"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <times/>
              <apply>
                <divide/>
                <apply>
                  <times/>
                  <ci> mwa94fdb43_b333_45b8_b5a4_2ff6b45b4751 </ci>
                  <ci> mw79a71ac6_adc6_4054_be96_1a4c8572f207 </ci>
                </apply>
                <apply>
                  <plus/>
                  <cn type="integer"> 1 </cn>
                  <apply>
                    <divide/>
                    <ci> mw79a71ac6_adc6_4054_be96_1a4c8572f207 </ci>
                    <apply>
                      <plus/>
                      <apply>
                        <times/>
                        <ci> mw4238f96a_209c_4b8c_a801_4d9d1ad7dd9f </ci>
                        <ci> mw794bf877_74b4_444f_b55b_2f79cac410e1 </ci>
                      </apply>
                      <ci> mw892d1df8_6887_434f_9313_9ba1556fa94a </ci>
                    </apply>
                  </apply>
                </apply>
              </apply>
              <apply>
                <minus/>
                <cn type="integer"> 1 </cn>
                <apply>
                  <divide/>
                  <apply>
                    <times/>
                    <ci> mw24142e8e_d7f9_4f4b_960b_9e06c9044bc8 </ci>
                    <ci> mw9a4ee33c_4eea_4b6d_b9ce_5e23aea41c01 </ci>
